[South ""]
[Dealer "N"]
[Vulnerable "None"]
[Deal ""]
[Scoring ""]
[Declarer ""]
[Contract ""]
[Result ""]
{<b>1-3)</b> <i>Play the king, as high a card as you can afford. If you play the 10,
South will win the trick with the jack and still have the ace left. When the
king wins, you can lead the 10 — top of your remaining doubleton — trapping
South’s jack and setting up two more tricks for the defense.</i>}
[BCFlags "17"]

[Event ""]
[Date ""]
[Board "1 summary"]
[West ""]
