{<b>5-1)</b> <i>When dummy plays the ace in the first layout, you want to play the king,
so</i> <i>that you will have a low card as the last card left in your hand to lead to</i>
<i>partner.</i>}
[BCFlags "17"]

[Event ""]
[Date ""]
[Board "5-2"]
[West ""]
[North ""]
[East ""]
[South ""]
