[Contract ""]
[Result ""]
{<b>5-2)</b> <i>If you play the 2 on the first trick, the suit will be blocked. You will
be</i> <i>able to take two tricks when you next gain the lead, but will have no low
card</i> <i>left to lead to partner’s remaining winners. Instead, play the king or
queen on</i> <i>the first trick, keeping a low card in your hand to lead to partner on
the</i> <i>third round of the suit.</i>}
[BCFlags "17"]

[Event ""]
[Date ""]
[Board "5-3"]
[West ""]
[North ""]
[East ""]
[South ""]
[Dealer "N"]
[Vulnerable "None"]
[Deal ""]
